{"id":"8b9204df0c7a83820bb9ee77bac07475441700e3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240643","title":"你们用云端 AI 做公家的东西会脱敏吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"hunono","excerpt":"问与答 - @hunono - A：我们有完善的脱敏手段，会正常脱敏。B：会手工、脚本或程序扫一遍脱敏。C：脱，当然脱了，你怎么证明我没脱敏？D：脱个蛋，又没绩效，要炸一起炸。E：脱敏是什么？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>A：我们有完善的脱敏手段，会正常脱敏。<br>B：会手工、脚本或程序扫一遍脱敏。<br>C：脱，当然脱了，你怎么证明我没脱敏？<br>D：脱个蛋，又没绩效，要炸一起炸。<br>E：脱敏是什么？</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/脱敏\"><li></li> 脱敏</a><a href=\"/tag/云端\"><li></li> 云端</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a></P><p><span>11 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-09 18:31:02 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066907\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/997a/6abb/210720_normal.png?m=1757041158\" alt=\"MoozLee\" data-uid=\"210720\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoozLee\">MoozLee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:32:06 +08:00\">16h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公家既然让我用 ai 来做东西了，说明他也不太重视这个东西</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066953\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0702fd0efaafa81a942de2f345c178fa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hoky\" data-uid=\"585657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hoky\">hoky</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:40:07 +08:00\">16h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用 Hermes 的时候，自己建了一个脱敏网关。<br>就是把姓名、手机号、身份证号、地址之类的敏感信息自动转换为唯一变量。<br>大模型回来的时候，再替换回来。<br>这个东西是个双刃剑，脱敏后就丢掉了部分语义。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066969\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f2b1/40bd/291889_normal.png?m=1665490174\" alt=\"rammiah\" data-uid=\"291889\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rammiah\">rammiah</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:42:19 +08:00\">16h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>需要对什么东西脱敏，密码密钥这种不可能给 ai 看，用户信息手机号这种都在数据库里，也不会让 ai 去查看的，ai 只改代码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b047/304e/123008_normal.png?m=1740965471\" alt=\"jydeng\" data-uid=\"123008\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jydeng\">jydeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:46:16 +08:00\">16h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 也读不了生产的东西，代码上没有什么敏感的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067096\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f035bc18f41ba651298d9d83d01e7f0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"rssf\" data-uid=\"112108\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rssf\">rssf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 16:03:21 +08:00\">15h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公家就算泄密关我屁事？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067886\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c3a0/8823/69279_normal.png?m=1422182500\" alt=\"Sting1226\" data-uid=\"69279\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sting1226\">Sting1226</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 18:27:31 +08:00\">13h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就我之前那公司的数据，白送给 AI 公司人都不要。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067898\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1788992498\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 18:31:02 +08:00\">13h 26m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>脱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"A：我们有完善的脱敏手段，会正常脱敏。B：会手工、脚本或程序扫一遍脱敏。C：脱，当然脱了，你怎么证明我没脱敏？D：脱个蛋，又没绩效，要炸一起炸。E：脱敏是什么？ 脱敏 云端 AI11 replies • 2026-09-09 18:31:02 +08:00 4 MoozLee 16h 25m ago 公家既然让我用 ai 来做东西了，说明他也不太重视这个东西 5 hoky 16h 17m ag